      </div><p><br></p><p>Qualifying will begin at noon on Sunday, and each driver will only get one try at qualifying for the Fast 12 and a second qualifying session. More on this procedure can be found <a href="https://www.indycar.com/-/media/Files/2026/NICS/07-500/indycar-QualDraw-Sat-26I500.pdf" rel="external nofollow" target="_blank">here</a>. </p><p>Fortunately for IndyCar, Sunday's activities at Indianapolis Motor Speedway won't be rained out. Forecasters are calling for a dry, warm and mostly sunny day on Sunday.</p><figure class="my-4 flex flex-col"><img alt="Indianapolis forecast" loading="lazy" width="320" height="180" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="shadow-md rounded-lg object-contain h-auto w-full" style="color:transparent" src="https://s.w-x.co/wxnext/img/0517_INdy_Snap-f2f40c.png?format=auto&optimize=medium&width=1600&quality=60"></figure><p>The green flag will drop on the iconic race at 12:45 p.m. on May 24.</p></div></div><div class="mt-8 border-t border-gray-200 pt-6" id="comments-section"><div class="relative"><div class="relative mb-6 min-h-[60px]"><div data-spotim-app="reactions" data-post-id="6a088b41517d55b0c192b669" data-theme="TWC Buddies" class="min-h-[60px]"><ow-inijsc75sp8><!-- -1 children --></ow-inijsc75sp8></div><div class="absolute inset-0 z-10 cursor-pointer bg-transparent" aria-label="Sign in to react to this content"></div></div><div class="relative"><div id="openweb-comments" data-spotim-module="conversation" data-post-id="6a088b41517d55b0c192b669" data-post-url="https://weather.com/2026/05/16/news/weather/rain-delays-qualifying-for-the-indy-500" data-article-tags="weather,news" class="min-h-[200px]" data-module-element-id="5883bab5a674f7fb618ce100cb40564c"><ow-inijsc75sp8><!-- -1 children --></ow-inijsc75sp8></div><div class="absolute inset-0 z-10 cursor-pointer bg-transparent" aria-label="Sign in to comment"></div></div></div></div></article>


